From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:34:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: power: add MT6797 CONN domain ID

Append ID 12 for the MT6797 CONN island. Keep the existing IDs stable;
the vendor SCP_SYS_CONN clock number belongs to a different namespace.

Internal experiment only; synthetic non-certifying author, no DCO.
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 include/dt-bindings/power/mt6797-power.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/power/mt6797-power.h b/include/dt-bindings/power/mt6797-power.h
index bd451d8..3ab9738 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/power/mt6797-power.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/power/mt6797-power.h
@@ -19,5 +19,6 @@
 #define MT6797_POWER_DOMAIN_MFG_CORE2		9
 #define MT6797_POWER_DOMAIN_MFG_CORE3		10
 #define MT6797_POWER_DOMAIN_MJC		11
+#define MT6797_POWER_DOMAIN_CONN		12
 
 #endif /* _DT_BINDINGS_POWER_MT6797_POWER_H */
